/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 110 0 R
/E (Emergency Request Intake: Captures patient location via GPS on Indian road networks \(NH, SH, city roads\). Severity Classification: AUTO-triages calls as Critical, Urgent, or Stable using symptom data. Ambulance Tracking: Real-time vehicle tracking on Indian city maps \(Delhi, Mumbai, Bengaluru grids\). Availability Checker: Monitors ALS/BLS unit status, crew readiness & equipment. Route Selection: Selects fastest route via OSRM/Google Maps India API with traffic & signal data. Traffic-Aware ETA: Calculates dynamic ETA using live congestion on Indian arterial roads. Hospital Mapping: Nearest NABH-accredited hospitals displayed with bed availability. Dispatcher Alerts: Instant push notifications & dashboard alerts to control room operators.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
